{"id":163582528370051,"type":"artist","name":"The Crystals","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":19,"info":{"img":"https://cdn-images.dzcdn.net/images/artist/8dee1b97e15d3fc401a626888fbdb458/1000x1000-000000-80-0-0.jpg","bio":"There are two bands with this name:\n\n1) Crystals was an Italian progressive rock band that was formed in 1973. Crystals functioned as a sort of supergroup, having several experienced and famous rock musicians in it. Their sound featured a blues-influenced hard rock style reminiscent of contemporaries such as Deep Purple. Crystals recorded one album in 1974 that was intended for release on the Cramps label. However, for mysterious reasons, it never appeared for years.","tags":["Progressive rock","rock","soul","jazz","60s"]},"works":[{"id":40180273655089,"type":"song","name":"He's a Rebel","artist":"The Crystals","year":1962,"weight":2,"yt":"waRbcqP4cUI","src":"singles","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":157497903047680,"name":"Billboard Hot 100 nº1 · 1960s","rank":80,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":241861551261061,"type":"album","name":"Twist Uptown","artist":"The Crystals","year":1962,"weight":9,"yt":"5o2R6v4AGlQ","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":258468824921983,"name":"RYM Top — Pop — Brill Building","rank":13,"scaruffi":null},{"id":105870353218901,"name":"RYM Top — Pop — Girl Group","rank":19,"scaruffi":null},{"id":97155353905344,"name":"RYM Top — R&B — Rhythm & Blues","rank":117,"scaruffi":null},{"id":106824060559178,"name":"RYM Top — R&B — Pop Soul","rank":166,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":4}},{"id":225660167184036,"type":"song","name":"Uptown","artist":"The Crystals","year":1962,"weight":4,"yt":"G0il2Qd3jcs","src":"charts,singles","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":175487015765550,"name":"Billboard Year-End 1962","rank":72,"scaruffi":null},{"id":132335824845498,"name":"Billboard Year-End Hot 100","rank":72,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":96089463721826,"type":"song","name":"Da Doo Ron Ron","artist":"The Crystals","year":1963,"weight":14,"yt":"L0dikX80Ed8","src":"books,charts,ensayos,singles","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[{"name":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","n":1}],"lists":[{"id":271704385319129,"name":"Billboard Year-End 1963","rank":46,"scaruffi":null},{"id":132335824845498,"name":"Billboard Year-End Hot 100","rank":46,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":127296488090804,"type":"album","name":"He's a Rebel","artist":"The Crystals","year":1986,"weight":9,"yt":"1D4o5yJ6arg","src":"books,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":105870353218901,"name":"RYM Top — Pop — Girl Group","rank":74,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":49053445539979,"type":"album","name":"(unnamed album)","artist":"The Crystals","year":null,"weight":4,"yt":null,"src":"ensayos","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[{"name":"A History of Rock Music in 500 Songs","n":1}],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}}],"members":[],"member_of":[],"genres":[{"id":247063341960131,"type":"genre","name":"Girl Group","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":204,"yt":null,"src":"ensayos"}],"album_genres":[{"id":247063341960131,"type":"genre","name":"Girl Group","n":2},{"id":247802226836647,"type":"genre","name":"Brill Building","n":1},{"id":242048506390872,"type":"genre","name":"Pop Soul","n":1},{"id":27872059790879,"type":"genre","name":"Rhythm & Blues","n":1}],"labels":[],"album_labels":[],"own_scenes":[],"scenes":[{"id":169050477627223,"name":"Antes del diluvio","book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","start":1957,"end":1962,"desc":"La «edad oscura» del rock'n'roll: los rebeldes son sustituidos por ídolos adolescentes educados y el Brill Building devuelve el poder a los compositores profesionales. Pero en esos años se incuban la revolución futura: la guitarra fuzz de Link Wray, los bailes de moda (el twist), el rock instrumental de guitarras (Duane Eddy, Ventures, Shadows), el calipso y el primer ska, el doo-wop más inventivo (Coasters, Drifters, Five Royales), el nacimiento del soul (Sam Cooke, Ray Charles, Motown, Stax), el estudio como instrumento de Joe Meek y el surf de los Beach Boys y del «muro de sonido» de Phil Spector.","color":"#f59e0b","family":"Raíces: rock'n'roll, country y roots","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#before-flood"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":127296488090804,"artist":"Crystals","artist_id":163582528370051,"title":"He's A Rebel","year":1962,"ess":0,"yt":"waRbcqP4cUI","kind":"s","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Antes del diluvio","scene_id":169050477627223,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#before-flood","chapters":["Sección 2.3"],"pages":[[1,19,null]]},{"id":96089463721826,"artist":"Crystals","artist_id":163582528370051,"title":"Da Doo Ron Ron","year":1963,"ess":0,"yt":"vMG11etlL-k","kind":"s","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Antes del diluvio","scene_id":169050477627223,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#before-flood","chapters":["Sección 2.3"],"pages":[[1,19,null]]}],"mentions":[{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":19,"text":"…and the American producer Phil Spector (also based in Los Angeles) invented a style of production named \"wall of sound\", best exemplified by the Crystals' He's A Rebel (1962) and Da Doo Ron Ron (1963). Surf music was an innocuous invention, but sometimes the most unlikely event turns out to be the…"}],"podcast":[{"kind":"podcast","title":"Episode Featuring Richard Berry's Involvement","body":"Richard Berry's early career involvement with The Blossoms was a topic discussed in a previous episode focused on The Crystals. \"most recently in the episode on the crystals, where we looked at how he'd been involved in the early career of the blossoms\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"A History of Rock Music in 500 Songs","episode":"Episode 106:\"Louie Louie\" by the Kingsmen","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S3agGJsxjpE"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Followers of The Shirelles' Template","body":"The Crystals are listed as one of the prominent girl groups that followed in the footsteps of The Shirelles, who set the template for the booming girl group sound of the 1960s. \"The Supremes, the Marvelettes, the crystals, the Ronettes, and the rest, all were following in the Chirrells footsteps.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"A History of Rock Music in 500 Songs","episode":"Episode 89: \"Will You Love Me Tomorrow?\" by the Shirelles","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Kns2HGcuSg"}]}],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":40180273655089,"type":"song","name":"He's a Rebel","work_year":1962,"list_id":157497903047680,"list":"Billboard Hot 100 nº1 · 1960s","src":"singles","rank":80,"year":1962,"note":"2 semanas","yt":"waRbcqP4cUI","scaruffi":null},{"id":225660167184036,"type":"song","name":"Uptown","work_year":1962,"list_id":175487015765550,"list":"Billboard Year-End 1962","src":"singles","rank":72,"year":1962,"note":"","yt":"G0il2Qd3jcs","scaruffi":null},{"id":225660167184036,"type":"song","name":"Uptown","work_year":1962,"list_id":132335824845498,"list":"Billboard Year-End Hot 100","src":"charts","rank":72,"year":1962,"note":null,"yt":"G0il2Qd3jcs","scaruffi":null},{"id":241861551261061,"type":"album","name":"Twist Uptown","list_id":258468824921983,"list":"RYM Top — Pop — Brill Building","src":"musthear","rank":13,"year":1962,"note":null,"yt":"5o2R6v4AGlQ","scaruffi":null},{"id":241861551261061,"type":"album","name":"Twist Uptown","list_id":105870353218901,"list":"RYM Top — Pop — Girl Group","src":"musthear","rank":19,"year":